# Cloudflare Pages Caching Headers

# HTML Pages - Never cache in browser memory without revalidating.
# Ensures new deploys show immediately to visitors without needing Ctrl+F5.
/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

# Immutable static assets generated by Astro (CSS, JS, optimized images with hashed filenames)
/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
